WEBVTT

15:32.047 --> 15:35.300
Why don't they answer? My ship!

15:38.470 --> 15:41.389
Blast! This'll take weeks to repair.

15:41.974 --> 15:45.018
Buzz Lightyear mission log,
stardate 4-0-7-2.

15:45.102 --> 15:48.396
My ship has run off course
en route to sector 1 2.

15:48.480 --> 15:50.982
I've crash-landed
on a strange planet.

15:51.066 --> 15:53.568
The impact must've awoken me
from hypersleep.

15:55.946 --> 15:58.406
Terrain seems a bit unstable.

15:59.158 --> 16:01.576
No readout yet
if the air is breathable.
